    "is_free": false,
    "detailed_description": "<h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Synopsis</h2><br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2784970/extras/1961cf1d067ce79bae26080673ec3b44.avif?t=1709788456\" width=454 height=158 /></span><br><br>One day, a cryptic message was posted on an online bulletin board.<br>Opening the mysterious URL revealed location coordinates. Despite sensing a dangerous atmosphere, you decide to venture to the location, thinking it might alleviate boredom.<h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Gameplay</h2>This game is a walking simulator set in a dimly lit, quiet building. Guided by the phone number and location information from the post, the protagonist pursues the enigmatic &quot;it.&quot; With a realistic atmosphere and a subtle sense of dread, players experience the terror of everyday encounters in this horror game.<h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Streaming Guidelines</h2>Streaming and content creation of this game are permitted, regardless of monetization status.",
    "about_the_game": "<h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Synopsis</h2><br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2784970/extras/1961cf1d067ce79bae26080673ec3b44.avif?t=1709788456\" width=454 height=158 /></span><br><br>One day, a cryptic message was posted on an online bulletin board.<br>Opening the mysterious URL revealed location coordinates. Despite sensing a dangerous atmosphere, you decide to venture to the location, thinking it might alleviate boredom.<h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Gameplay</h2>This game is a walking simulator set in a dimly lit, quiet building. Guided by the phone number and location information from the post, the protagonist pursues the enigmatic &quot;it.&quot; With a realistic atmosphere and a subtle sense of dread, players experience the terror of everyday encounters in this horror game.<h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Streaming Guidelines</h2>Streaming and content creation of this game are permitted, regardless of monetization status.",
    "short_description": "&quot;Fascinated by the cryptic message 'Find 090-\u25a0\u25a0\u25a0\u25a0-\u25a0\u25a0\u25a0\u25a0 https://\u25a0\u25a0\u25a0\u25a0\u25a0\u25a0\u25a0\u25a0\u25a0\u25a0,' you decide to embark on a journey to the specified location. Armed with a phone number and coordinates, you embark on a quest to uncover 'it,' experiencing a quiet sense of dread in this walking simulator.&quot;",
